DESCRIPTION:Clean Slate is a fashion show centered around new beginnings\,
  reinvention\, and the freedom to redefine yourself. Through fashion\, mo
 vement\, and creative expression\, NOVA invites students to explore what 
 it means to leave behind what no longer serves them and step into somethi
 ng new.\nEach look represents a different interpretation from shedding ol
 d identities and expectations to embracing growth\, individuality\, and t
 ransformation. Clean Slate is not about erasing the past\, it’s about rec
 ognizing that you have the freedom to create what comes next.\nCome exper
 ience a night where fashion becomes a blank canvas and every person gets 
 the chance to tell a new story.\n \n\nHosted by: New Generation Of Vision
 ary Artists\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.
 campuslabs.com/engage/event/12984522
DTEND:20261205T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20261128T073028Z
