DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate the rich history\, traditions\, and vi
 brancy of Haiti! This event will highlight Haitian culture through music\
 , dance\, art\, and food\, giving students an opportunity to experience t
 he heart of the island. From Kompa rhythms and Creole expressions to trad
 itional dishes and cultural displays\, the night will be filled with lear
 ning\, community\, and celebration. Whether you have Haitian roots or sim
 ply want to explore and appreciate a new culture\, this event is open to 
 all. Come ready to enjoy\, connect\, and celebrate Haiti!\n\nHosted by: H
 aitian Student Association\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: htt
