DESCRIPTION:MSU Bible Studies – I Lift Jesus (ILJ)\nJoin I Lift Jesus (ILJ
 ) at Montclair State University for a time of Bible study\, prayer\, fell
 owship\, and spiritual growth. Our gatherings provide a welcoming space f
 or students to explore God's Word\, ask questions\, strengthen their fait
 h\, and grow in their relationship with Jesus Christ.\nWhether you are ne
 w to the faith\, seeking a deeper understanding of Scripture\, or simply 
 looking for a community to grow with\, you are welcome. Together\, we are
  learning to know God\, live out His Word\, and pursue Him beyond the wal
 ls of a classroom.\nCome as you are. Bring your Bible. Grow with us.\n\nH
 osted by: I lift Jesus\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https:/
 /montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/13000055
