DESCRIPTION:\n💌 Hello Angels! 👼🏻💗\nGet ready to strike a pose\, make s
 ome memories\, and get crafty with us! 📸🎀✨\nAs we wrap up another wonde
 rful semester together\, the Sonny Angel Club invites you to our Polaroid
  Party! 💕 We're bringing all the Pinterest vibes with an adorable photo 
 booth backdrop\, cute decorations\, and plenty of opportunities to captur
 e your favorite moments with your fellow angels! 🪽\n📸 Strike a Pose! Ta
 ke some adorable pictures with your friends at our Polaroid Snapping Area
 !\n🎀 Decorate Your Memories! Get creative by decorating Polaroid frames 
 with cute stickers\, gems\, and all sorts of fun embellishments!\n💌 Make
  Your Own Pins! Design and create personalized pins to take home as a lit
 tle keepsake!\n🍓 Hang Out & Have Fun! Whether you're crafting\, taking p
 ictures\, or just catching up with friends\, come enjoy a cozy afternoon 
 filled with creativity\, laughter\, and good company!\nThis event is all 
 about celebrating the friendships\, memories\, and little moments that ha
 ve made this semester so special! 💗\n🎟️ Don't Forget to RSVP! Spots and
  crafting supplies are limited\, so make sure to RSVP through Engage to s
 ecure your spot! We want all our angels to have a chance to join in on th
 e fun\, so please RSVP! 💌✨\nWe can't wait to see all our angels together
  for one last picture-perfect celebration! Bring your besties\, your crea
 tivity\, and your cutest poses! 📷🎀\nWith lots of love\,\nSonny Angel Cl
 ub E-Board 👼🏻💌\n\nHosted by: Sonny Angel Club\n\nAdditional Informatio
 n can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12985998
